    <!-- https://w3id.org/seas/FixedDurationSum -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/seas/FixedDurationSum">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/seas/TimeSum"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Utility class to qualify the relation between a property and its sum over a time interval whose duration is fixed.

For example:

```
[] a seas:FixedDurationSum ;
   seas:summedProperty &lt;fridge/1/consumptionPower&gt; ;
   seas:sumProperty &lt;fridge/1/consumption&gt; ;
   seas:sumDuration &quot;PT24H&quot;^^xsd:duration .
```

means that at any time, the value of `&lt;fridge/1/consumption&gt;` is the sum of `&lt;fridge/1/consumptionPower&gt;` over the past day.
</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/seas/TimeOntology"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Fixed Duration Sum</rdfs:label>
        <vs:term_status>stable</vs:term_status>
    </owl:Class>
    


